     [38;5;246mconfig.js maps location.hostname to an endpoint. No deploy machinery; adding an environment is a small code change.
[39m  [38;5;246m2.[39m Per-env file, swapped at deploy
     [38;5;246mconfig.js holds one env's values; the deploy overwrites it. New environments need no code change but require a [39m
